  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fishing Agreements in Tocantins</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fishers in Araguacema and Couto de Magalhes face challenges created by unreliable food supply limited conservation practices and inconsistent income. Cooperativa de Trabalho Prestao de Servios Assistncia Tcnica e Extenso Rural (COOPTER) works to establish cooperation agreements to facilitate lake fishing develop resource management plans for pirarucu (arapaima gigas) stocks and improve processing methods and income-generation opportunities. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Brazil. COOPTER&apos;s activities bolster efforts to counteract environmental degradation and protect the natural resources that communities depend on.</narrative>
  </description>
